# D3-MI-002: Heating does not increase every mineral solubility
# Simulation candidate; no runtime observations are claimed.
register lv3
new
add v1 water 50mL @ 20C
add v1 gypsum 0.005mol
add v2 water 50mL @ 20C
add v2 KNO3 0.20mol
stir v1 300rpm 30s
stir v2 300rpm 30s
inspect
heat v1 10kJ
heat v2 10kJ
measure v1 thermometer
measure v2 thermometer
look v1
look v2
inspect
